     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Karine,<div><br></div><div>長寬資料轉換請參考使用 tidyr 或 reshape2 套件, 折線圖第1條線可用 plot(, type=&quot;l&quot;)，其他資料用 lines( )加上:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sjDadOcNYew/V_z-pWI2nxI/AAAAAAAAKyA/WGyA-ABtxcE_HILfLr9NwAGwVe4KhE_YgCLcB/s1600/%25E5%25A6%2582%25E4%25BD%2595%25E7%2595%25AB%25E5%2580%258B%25E5%2588%25A5%25E5%2580%258B%25E6%25A1%2588%25E7%259A%2584%25E6%258A%2598%25E7%25B7%259A%25E5%259C%2596-%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AF%25AC%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E8%25BD%2589%25E6%258F%259B.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sjDadOcNYew/V_z-pWI2nxI/AAAAAAAAKyA/WGyA-ABtxcE_HILfLr9NwAGwVe4KhE_YgCLcB/s1600/%2525E5%2525A6%252582%2525E4%2525BD%252595%2525E7%252595%2525AB%2525E5%252580%25258B%2525E5%252588%2525A5%2525E5%252580%25258B%2525E6%2525A1%252588%2525E7%25259A%252584%2525E6%25258A%252598%2525E7%2525B7%25259A%2525E5%25259C%252596-%2525E9%252595%2525B7%2525E5%2525AF%2525AC%2525E8%2525B3%252587%2525E6%252596%252599%2525E8%2525BD%252589%2525E6%25258F%25259B.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237912891000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JMCqzpQYCwQTgqV58wPCW\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sjDadOcNYew/V_z-pWI2nxI/AAAAAAAAKyA/WGyA-ABtxcE_HILfLr9NwAGwVe4KhE_YgCLcB/s400/%25E5%25A6%2582%25E4%25BD%2595%25E7%2595%25AB%25E5%2580%258B%25E5%2588%25A5%25E5%2580%258B%25E6%25A1%2588%25E7%259A%2584%25E6%258A%2598%25E7%25B7%259A%25E5%259C%2596-%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AF%25AC%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E8%25BD%2589%25E6%258F%259B.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"395\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: 如何畫個別個案的折線圖, 本例為長資料轉換為寬資料</div><div># date: 2016.10.11</div><div><br></div><div>mydata &lt;- read.csv(&quot;data_r.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div># method 1</div><div>library(tidyr)</div><div># gather 寬資料轉換為長資料</div><div># spread 長資料轉換為寬資料</div><div><br></div><div>mydatawide1 &lt;- spread(mydata, casename, score, fill=0)</div><div>mydatawide1</div><div><br></div><div># method 2</div><div>library(reshape2)</div><div># melt  寬資料轉換為長資料</div><div># dcast 長資料轉換為寬資料</div><div><br></div><div>mydatawide2 &lt;- dcast(mydata, time ~ casename, value.var=&quot;score&quot;, fill=0)</div><div>mydatawide2</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><br>Karine Koh於 2016年10月11日星期二 UTC+8下午9時14分21秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">請教高手們如何重整資料結構與畫出非連續數值的折線圖呢?<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"216\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:162pt\">\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"72\" span=\"3\" style=\"width:54pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" width=\"72\" style=\"height:16.5pt;width:54pt\">casename</td>\r\n  <td width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\">time</td>\r\n  <td width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\">score</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s1</td>\r\n  <td>0.25</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s1</td>\r\n  <td>0.75</td>\r\n  <td>1</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s1</td>\r\n  <td>2.5</td>\r\n  <td>1</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s1</td>\r\n  <td>3.25</td>\r\n  <td>2</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s2</td>\r\n  <td>0.25</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s3</td>\r\n  <td>0.25</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s3</td>\r\n  <td>0.5</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s3</td>\r\n  <td>1.25</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s7</td>\r\n  <td>0.25</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s8</td>\r\n  <td>0.25</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s8</td>\r\n  <td>0.5</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s8</td>\r\n  <td>5</td>\r\n  <td>1</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">s8</td>\r\n  <td>6</td>\r\n  <td>1</td>\r\n </tr></tbody></table></div><div><br></div><div>如上 (或附檔)，我有一筆資料，每個個案依評估時間點逐一輸入結果。因此，在casename裡面會有重複的個案編號，但旁邊的 time(評估時間點) 數值會不同，而相對應於 time 會有該時間點的 score 分數。</div><div>全部的 time 會有 24個點，但每個個案可能只會測得其中的 1 - 4 個點。</div><div>times 的24個點為:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.25 0.50 0.75 1.00 1.25 1.50 1.75 2.00 2.25 2.50 2.75 3.00 3.25 3.50 3.75 4.00 4.50 4.75 5.00 5.25 5.50 5.75 6.00<br></div><div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"1728\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:1296pt\"><tbody><tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\"><td height=\"22\" width=\"72\" style=\"height:16.5pt;width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" width=\"72\" style=\"width:54pt\"><br></td></tr></tbody></table><div>我現在的想法是作成一個 data frame，第一欄為 times，第二欄之後為每一個個案的值，如下:</div></div><div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"175\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:134pt\">\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"45\" style=\"width:34pt\">\r\n <col width=\"26\" span=\"5\" style=\"width:20pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" width=\"45\" style=\"height:16.5pt;width:34pt\">times</td>\r\n  <td width=\"26\" style=\"width:20pt\">s1</td>\r\n  <td width=\"26\" style=\"width:20pt\">s2</td>\r\n  <td width=\"26\" style=\"width:20pt\">s3</td>\r\n  <td width=\"26\" style=\"width:20pt\">s7</td>\r\n  <td width=\"26\" style=\"width:20pt\">s8</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">0.25 </td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">0.50 </td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"22\" style=\"height:16.5pt\">0.75 </td>\r\n  <td>1</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"22\" style=\